    "Name": "Weevil",
    "Details": "The original Weevil variant, the -L31, mounts an AC/2 in the right arm and a ER Large Laser in the left. Due to only mounting ten single heatsinks, the 'Mech still runs quite hot even with just a single energy weapon.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Advanced Optics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
